              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "latrunculus, latrunculī — \"a piece in a board game; a robber\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Duo amīcī latrunculīs lūdunt. Two friends play the board game of soldiers."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine, second declension. First a little robber or hired soldier, then a piece in a war game played on a board."
            }
          ]
        },
